      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was only able to reproduce this when using the 'Go Home' button. Do you have Summer Solitude set as your home?\nI tried switching between a bunch of different worlds while sitting in chairs and couldn't reproduce this. However, I tried setting my home world to a variety of different worlds and, in all cases, selecting 'Go Home' while seated on a chair in some other world reproduced the problem after appearing in the chosen home world.\nI tested in both VR mode and desktop mode and observed the same behaviour.\n(Using: Build 933, Oculus Rift S, VRChat Oculus store version.)",
